 :scenarios
 [{:id "jp-direct"
   :label "Japanese corporation imports from Hong Kong and sells in Japan"
   :tax-model :japan-corporation
   :assumptions
   ["The Japanese corporation is the importer of record and preserves import permits and tax records."
    "It registers for qualified invoices when B2B customers require them."
    "K16 hardware and Murakumo service revenue are separately identified when their tax treatment or simplified-tax category differs."]
   :outcomes
   ["One Japanese customs, consumption-tax, customer-contract, warranty, and corporate-income-tax operating surface."
    "No cross-border PE position is needed for the hardware distribution margin."
    "The simplified-tax election may reduce consumption-tax payment when eligibility and classification are confirmed."]
   :scores {:expected-value 0.82
